OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sat 22 Aug to Mon 31 Aug
OL,6,FThis period is likely to start largely
OL,7,Fdry and settled across the UK, as a
OL,8,Fridge of high pressure sets in. A few
OL,9,Fshowers are likely in the far north
OL,10,Fand possibly the far southeast though.
OL,11,FConditions look like turning
OL,12,Fincreasingly unsettled through next
OL,13,Fweek, as low pressure gradually
OL,14,Fbecomes dominant, squeezing the ridge
OL,15,Foff to the northeast and southwest.
OL,16,FMost places are likely to see some
OL,17,Frain or showers, which may be heavy
OL,18,Fwith a risk of thunder at times. It
OL,19,Fmay become breezy if not windy at
OL,20,Ftimes too. Temperatures are likely to
OL,21,Fbe near or a little below normal
OL,22,Foverall, with some chilly nights at
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Ffirst, but brief warm, humid spells
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
OL,24,Fare possible at times, especially in
OL,25,Fthe south.
